From 9e8089b263771c2cac21906a5521ec87a21aa611 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ss3ds <ss3ds@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:59:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed the Scratch-Off, Photo Album, Pal Park, Poke Ball
 seal and Accessory Portrait overlays (87, 109, 67, 57, 41)

These apps are launched only through overlay templates, so the translator never rooted them and opening the screen aborted with [SS-MISSING]. Seed the overlay files (as 0134, 0141, 0142 did) and drop the matching Missing() stubs. Statically checked in the 2026-10-29 audit; not yet compiled or run on device. Safari Zone editors (108) and the Wi-Fi apps (39) are left out: they need link and DWC checks.
